  "question": "Where\u2019s the closest restaurant you hit on the way to L Bar Ranch, Seboyeta, NM from New Mexico Slaughter House, Albuquerque, NM?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-106.657079 35.199273)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-107.267207 35.395641)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'restaurant'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-106.657079 35.199273)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-106.657079 35.199273)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
